            <div xml:id="d762">

                <pb facs="0843" n="748" xml:id="pg748"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.00/602: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-03-06T21:00:00+09:00">March 6, 1936—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 6—10:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Hirota is now endeavoring to form a Cabinet but has met certain difficulties,
                    apparently with the army, and has not yet succeeded.</p>
                <p>The appointments of Yuasa [as] Lord Keeper of the Seals, and of Matsudaira,
                    formerly Ambassador to Great Britain, as Household Minister have been
                    announced.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
